Research CLI for the source-preserving lexical search prototype

Usage: candidate042-cli <COMMAND>

Commands:
  build             Build a new SQLite index from an accepted archive; the destination must not exist
  search            Read a JSON Query from stdin or --query and emit one JSON response
  info              Emit counts for the grouped dictionary or legacy archive store
  dictionary-build  Build a fresh grouped-dictionary store (default: XDG/HOME grouped store)
  dictionary-query  Query the grouped store (default: XDG/HOME path); reads --request or stdin
  verify            Explicitly audit one or all integrity boundaries of an existing grouped store
  jbotci-import     Normalize a pinned raw jbotci export into the complete versioned dictionary document
  jbotci-check      Validate the raw export and optionally compare it with a normalized release document
  data-pack         Prepare an ignored local pack payload without opening a dictionary store
  help              Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help     Print help
  -V, --version  Print version

Grouped dictionary commands use an explicit STORE when supplied; otherwise they use XDG_DATA_HOME/vlajmaji/stores/default, falling back to HOME/.local/share/vlajmaji/stores/default. Query and info never create or download a store. This default location is intended for a future dictionary-of-dictionaries; the initial Lensisku-only store is provisional.
